HEADS AAA
START *** SETUP     *** SSU
SETUP *** CHECK_COL *** SRU

CHECK_COL #=* CHECK_COL *** DDS
CHECK_COL #_* CHECK_COL *** DDS
CHECK_COL #|_ CHECK_NXT **F SSS
CHECK_COL #|F FOUND     *** SSS
CHECK_COL _** CHECK_NXT *** UUS

// Move back to the top
CHECK_NXT #** CHECK_NXT *** UUS
CHECK_NXT _** CHECK_RT  *** DDS
CHECK_RT  *** CHECK_COL *** SRS

// FOUND
//   - Move back to the top
//   - While moving back down, place a | in every row then clear to the right
//   - Stop
FOUND          *** FOUND_MOVE_TOP *** SSS
FOUND_MOVE_TOP #** FOUND_MOVE_TOP *** UUS
FOUND_MOVE_TOP _** FOUND_DO_WORK  *** DDS

FOUND_DO_WORK  #!* FOUND_CLEAR_RT *|* SRS
FOUND_DO_WORK  #_* FOUND_DO_WORK  *** DDS
FOUND_DO_WORK  _** CLEAN          *** SSS
FOUND_CLEAR_RT #!* FOUND_CLEAR_RT *_* SRS
FOUND_CLEAR_RT #_* FOUND_GO_BACK  *** SLS
FOUND_GO_BACK  #_* FOUND_GO_BACK  *** SLS
FOUND_GO_BACK  #!* FOUND_DO_WORK  *** DDS

CLEAN *** STOP **_ SSS
